        "summary": "Garen gains a burst of Move Speed, breaking free of all slows affecting him. His next attack strikes a vital area of his foe, dealing bonus damage and silencing them.",
        "bodyHtml": "Garen removes all <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> effects on him and gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">35% Move Speed</span> for 1.4/1.95/2.5/3.05/3.6 second(s).<br /><br />His next Attack <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Silences</span> for 1.5 seconds and does <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30/60/90/120/150 + ([[si:scalead]]150% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The empowered Attack expires after 4.5 seconds.<br />This Ability triggers spell effects upon dealing damage.</span>",
