        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Garen rapidly spins his sword around his body, dealing physical damage to nearby enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Garen rapidly spins his sword for 3 seconds, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(4/7/10/13/16 + ([[si:scalead]]40/43/46/49/52% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> 7 times over the duration. The nearest enemy takes <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">25% increased damage</span>. Champions hit by 6 strikes lose <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">25% Armor</span> for 6 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span>: Garen ends this Ability early.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Gains one strike from every <span>25% Attack Speed</span> from items and levels.<br />Can critically strike for <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(4/7/10/13/16 + ([[si:scalead]]40/43/46/49/52% Attack Damage)) × (0.7 + [[si:scalecritmult]]30% Critical Strike Damage) physical damage</span>.</span>",
